  "question": {
    "text": "Given that, velocity of light in quartz = 1.5 x 10<sup>8</sup> m/s and velocity of light in glycerine = (9/4) x 10<sup>8</sup> m/s. If a slab made of quartz is placed in glycerine as shown in the figure. How much is the shift (in cm) in the position of the object produced by slab?<br />\r<br />\r&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/EM0032992_Question.jpg\" style=\"width: 263px; height: 245px;\" />",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "6",
  "solution": {
    "text": "&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/EM0032992_Ans.jpg\" style=\"width: 272px; height: 236px;\" /><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mtext>n</mtext><mtext>quartz</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><msub><mtext>n</mtext><mtext>glycerine</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>&#956;</mi><mtext>rel</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mtext>n</mtext><mtext>quartz</mtext></msub><msub><mtext>n</mtext><mtext>glycerine</mtext></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtext>shift</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>t</mtext><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msub><mi>&#956;</mi><mtext>rel</mtext></msub></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mn>8</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>cm</mo></math>",
